MODULE: UndoSettlesRetryRechecksReplication
TARGET: UndoSettles
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: retry refuses an already-cleared unwind when replication later becomes enabled
PERTURBS: UndoFinish

--- FIND
    /\ running /\ undo = "swapping" /\ cleared
--- REPLACE
    /\ running /\ undo = "swapping" /\ cleared /\ ~replicated
--- END
